gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Howdy, Ranger! PROFESSOR BIRCH here.\p"
	.string "Welcome to your first active rescue\n"
	.string "in the world of POKéMON!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is what we call a “POKéMON.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "HOENN has seen big changes in\n"
	.string "the last 25 years.\p"
	.string "You'll see some for yourself\n"
	.string "on your rounds.\p"
	.string "As you earn BADGES, you'll be able\n"
	.string "to train stronger POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Someday, a whole rescue crew may\n"
	.string "be counting on you and your partner.\p"
	.string "So take on the LEAGUE challenge!\n"
	.string "We encourage every Ranger to try.\p"
	.string "Most Ranger ranks require a certain\n"
	.string "number of BADGES for promotion.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "Let's get your Ranger ID ready."
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Choose your ID portrait."
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "What name goes on your Ranger ID?"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "Print {PLAYER} on your ID?"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Ranger ID issued to {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "One last thing before you head out.\p"
	.string "Keep your Ranger gear intact and\n"
	.string "your wits about you, Ranger.\p"
	.string "Have fun out there.\n"
	.string "And return safely.\p"
	.string "End recording."
	.string "$"
